      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, je te reconnais...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTu es l’assistant<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe de la célèbre détective, Millie !\nJe t’ai aperçu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à ses côtés.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas du tout.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200064007500200074006F00750074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh... On peut dire ça...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002E002E002E0020004F006E0020007000650075007400200064006900720065002000E70061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cela n’a guère d’importance. Peux-tu m’aider ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430065006C00610020006E2019006100200067007500E8007200650020006420190069006D0070006F007200740061006E00630065002E00200050006500750078002D007400750020006D2019006100690064006500720020003F00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voici mon problème : j’ai confié une précieuse clé\nà mon adorable Trousselin.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais durant une de nos sorties, Trousselin\na égaré cette clé...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610069007300200064007500720061006E007400200075006E00650020006400650020006E006F007300200073006F00720074006900650073002C002000540072006F0075007300730065006C0069006E000A0061002000E900670061007200E900200063006500740074006500200063006C00E9002E002E002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avez-vous une piste ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100760065007A002D0076006F0075007300200075006E00650020007000690073007400650020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quels endroits avez-vous visités ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750065006C007300200065006E00640072006F0069007400730020006100760065007A002D0076006F0075007300200076006900730069007400E900730020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Laisse-moi réfléchir... J’ai visité un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>salon\nde coiffure<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>. C’était la première fois que j’y<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nallais, je ne me souviens plus de l’adresse...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 153
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’étais ravie de la coupe qu’ils m’ont faite, aussi\nme suis-je assise dans un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>café <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>près du salon<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npour déguster un délicieux thé.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Enfin, j’ai été invitée à me battre sur le <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>terrain de\ncombat <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>à l’arrière du café, où j’ai, bien entendu,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nremporté une victoire éblouissante.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 156
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si seulement je pouvais retrouver ce salon de\ncoiffure par lequel j’ai commencé ma promenade...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bref, voici tous les indices dont je dispose.\nÀ toi de jouer. Retrouve ma clé, je te prie !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le jour où j’ai perdu mes clés, je suis allée dans\nun salon de coiffure, puis un café, et enfin<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nun terrain de combat situé à l’arrière de celui-ci.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCommence par trouver un salon de coiffure\nproche d’un café.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 218
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous avez trouvé une clé finement ouvragée !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006100760065007A002000740072006F0075007600E900200075006E006500200063006C00E9002000660069006E0065006D0065006E00740020006F0075007600720061006700E90065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu es là ! J’ai fini par me souvenir de cet endroit.\nC’est ici que j’ai obtenu mon éclatante victoire !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! Ma clé !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002000210020004D006100200063006C00E90020002100100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Troutrou...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540072006F007500740072006F0075002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ne t’en fais pas, Trousselin ! Ce n’est pas de ta\nfaute, si nous avons perdu cette clé. C’est moi<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nqui ai voulu venir ici. Je suis responsable !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 151
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Trou ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540072006F00750020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai entendu dire qu’un Trousselin ne perdait\njamais une clé qu’il apprécie...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai appris ma leçon : je ne te confierai plus que\ndes clés que tu trouveras à ton goût !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les autres resteront dans mon sac !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065007300200061007500740072006500730020007200650073007400650072006F006E0074002000640061006E00730020006D006F006E00200073006100630020002100100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Troutrou ! ♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540072006F007500740072006F0075002000210020266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et voilà ! Comme ça, maintenant, on partage\nla responsabilité !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200076006F0069006C00E00020002100200043006F006D006D0065002000E70061002C0020006D00610069006E00740065006E0061006E0074002C0020006F006E00200070006100720074006100670065000A006C006100200072006500730070006F006E0073006100620069006C0069007400E90020002100100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci de ton aide, jeune assistant<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe.\nAccepte ceci en remerciement.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
